OL,5,G0225 Britain's Hotel Murders
OL,6,     FEmergency services respond to a
OL,7,     Ffire by a hotel and find a burned
OL,8,     Fhuman body. And when a missing
OL,9,     Fperson report comes in, the
OL,10,     Fconnection between the two cases
OL,11,     Fis quickly made. (Ep1)
